  :tutorial/content "**MTH 341 — Post-reading Questions: §§7.1.1–7.1.3**\n\nDue: 2026-11-10\nDue time: 11:59 p.m. PST\nDate imported: 2026-11-09\nSource: [Canvas — Post-reading Questions -Sections 7.1.1-7.1.3](https://canvas.oregonstate.edu/courses/2064363/quizzes/3193301)\n\nStudy answers and explanations are independently authored additions. Original choice text and ordering are retained. Question 3 has a source terminology issue; its feedback distinguishes the characteristic polynomial from the characteristic equation.\n\n## Instructions\n\nAnswer all three multiple-choice questions. Canvas specifies no time limit."
